      </p>

      <p lang="en">
        The article examines Bishop Nikolaj Velimirović’s views on war, patriotism,
        sacrifice for the homeland, and the relationship between Christian spirituality
        and national obligation in the final years before the Second World War.
      </p>
    </section>

